# On machines that use the ~/.agents/AGENTS.md single-source-of-truth layout,
# ~/.pi/agent/AGENTS.md is a machine-managed symlink (pi/claude/codex/gemini
# all share it). Stow must not fight it — skip this file here.
# On a fresh Linux box without ~/.agents, stow still applies it as a fallback,
# and chezmoi includes it for the Windows pi config.
^/\.pi/agent/AGENTS\.md$
